# Reporting Rules

## Evidence Bundles

Reports must include:

- Repository identity + exact commit SHA.
- Build id / graph snapshot id / rule pack hash.
- Finding records with locations, code excerpts (bounded), graph path summaries, taint summaries.
- Confidence and verification state.
- Operator attribution for manual overrides.

## Formats

- Human-readable (Markdown/HTML/PDF export path) + machine-readable (JSON/CycloneDX-style extensions only if justified).

## Non-Hallucination Contract

- No fabricated CVEs, versions, or filenames; if unknown, state unknown.
- Clearly separate **facts** (parsed) vs **interpretations** (models).

## Reproducibility

- Document commands/commit of tooling to reproduce static portions; dynamic portions list sandbox image digest.

## Retention & Privacy

- Redact secrets from excerpts; configurable retention windows.

## Review

- High/Critical external reports require second human approval path (future workflow hook).
